    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IEm">I Em</ref> 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be mánsworum ⁊ liblacum.] [Ld] Ða ðe mansweriað ⁊ liblac wyrcað beon hi a fram ælcum Godes dæle aworpene, buton he to rihtre dædbote gecirran þe geornor.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Those who commit perjury, and practise sorcery shall be cast out forever from the fellowship of God, unless they proceed with special zeal to undertake the prescribed penance.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ða ðe mansweriað ⁊ lyblat wyrcað syn hy á fram ælcum Godes dæle aworpene, buten hy to rihtre dædbote gecyrran.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
